- Test setup script interface and flushing mechanism need to be defined (how test script initializes server and flushes database contents)
- Verification that all existing code (from previous merged tasks) integrates correctly and meets goal requirements
- Exact file naming in assets directory: confirm whether `assets/css/styles.css` and `assets/js/main.js` or root-level `styles.css` and `app.js`
- Business contact details in contact section are currently placeholders (example.com email, fake phone) - confirm if examples are acceptable or need real values

