## Constraints from the existing codebase

- Must use vanilla HTML, CSS, JavaScript (no frameworks)
- Must use local MongoDB only (no cloud database)
- Must use Express for backend (lightweight)
- Server runs on port 27107
- Database must be named `temp_work_db` at `mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017`
- POST `/api/contact` endpoint for contact form submission
- GET `/api/health` endpoint for connectivity check
- Contact submissions stored in `contacts` collection
- Tests use same production `temp_work_db` database with ability to flush contents
- Test data persists for manual verification
- Tests use separate setup script for initialization
- Frontend must work as file:// protocol (no backend) and with backend on localhost:27107
- File structure: `index.html`, `assets/css/styles.css` (or `styles.css`), `assets/js/main.js` (or `app.js`), `server.js`, `db/connection.js`, `db/schema.js`, `package.json`, `tests/api.test.js`, `README.md`
